tle vs liverpool","rank":38},{"geo":"NP","keyword":"newcastle vs liverpool","rank":40}]},{"key":"brighton vs tromso","zh":"布萊頓 對陣 特羅姆瑟","en":"Brighton vs Tromso","countryCount":4,"countries":[{"geo":"TH","keyword":"ไบรตัน พบ ทรอมโซ่","rank":5},{"geo":"SG","keyword":"brighton vs tromso","rank":9},{"geo":"MY","keyword":"brighton vs tromso","rank":15},{"geo":"BD","keyword":"brighton vs tromso","rank":21}]},{"key":"kuku kohli","zh":"庫庫·科利","en":"Kuku Kohli","countryCount":4,"countries":[{"geo":"IN","keyword":"kuku kohli","rank":7},{"geo":"PK","keyword":"kuku kohli","rank":14},{"geo":"BD","keyword":"কুকু কোহলি","rank":15},{"geo":"NP","keyword":"kuku kohli","rank":15}]},{"key":"la liga","zh":"西甲聯賽","en":"la liga","countryCount":4,"countries":[{"geo":"ID","keyword":"la liga","rank":16},{"geo":"NP","keyword":"la liga","rank":25},{"geo":"MY","keyword":"西甲","rank":46},{"geo":"TW","keyword":"西甲","rank":48}]}],"summary":"・體育賽事與足球聯賽橫跨多國熱搜，其中巴塞隆納以 2 比 0 擊敗畢爾包的西甲賽事備受關注，在印尼、柬埔寨與孟加拉等地皆名列第一，同時車路士對盧頓的比賽也在東南亞多國掀起熱潮。\n・重大天災引發區域高度關注，尼泊爾與西藏發生造成數百人死亡、逾千人失蹤的災難性洪水與土石流，在菲律賓、台灣、新加坡等 12 個亞洲國家引起廣泛討論。\n・東南亞區域體育話題備受矚目，越南對陣泰國的東協錦標賽（ASEAN Cup）賽事在越南奪冠後登上多國熱搜，越南拿下榜首，柬埔寨與泰國也同步關注。\n・西洋流行文化與名人回顧跨區發燒，美國傳奇鄉村歌手桃莉·巴頓因紐約時報報導與影院推出個人回顧展，在新加坡與菲律賓等地登上熱搜前幾名。\n・遊戲產業與藝術領域亦在多國引起討論，備受期待的《俠盜獵車手VI》（GTA VI）以及日本藝術家草間彌生在香港、日本與台灣等地皆有亮眼排名。","summaryEn":"・Sports events and football matches dominated regional trends, led by Barcelona's 2-0 La Liga victory over Athletic Bilbao, which ranked first in Indonesia, Cambodia, and Bangladesh, alongside widespread interest in the Chelsea versus Luton Town match.\n・Natural disasters triggered major cross-border attention, as catastrophic floods and landslides in Nepal and Tibet killed hundreds and left over 1,000 missing, driving search interest across 12 Asian markets including the Philippines, Taiwan, and Singapore.\n・Regional sports rivalry captured regional audiences, with the ASEAN Cup clash between Vietnam and Thailand trending heavily after Vietnam's dramatic championship win, sparking discussion in Vietnam, Cambodia, and Thailand.\n・Western pop culture and legendary figures trended widely, as American country music icon Dolly Parton gained strong attention in Singapore, the Philippines, and Malaysia following retrospective features and media coverage.\n・Gaming and contemporary art also maintained a cross-regional presence, with high anticipation for Grand Theft Auto VI (GTA VI) and Japanese artist Yayoi Kusama securing notable rankings across several markets including Hong Kong, Japan, and Taiwan."}}